# Narration lab: the experimental variants stay local; versioned are the ones the work builds on (2026-10-27):
# agent6 (the agentic writer), narrative13 (the best single-call writer) and craft, whose design run it writes on.
evals/narration_lab/variants/*
!evals/narration_lab/variants/agent6/
!evals/narration_lab/variants/narrative13/
!evals/narration_lab/variants/craft/

